<title>SRI LANKA: Tea Smallholder nine-month net 36 pct up.</title>
<headline>Tea Smallholder nine-month net 36 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd, for the nine monds ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			 9 months 1996	   9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	    549.35	vs	  365.30</p>
<p>    Net profit	   49.50	vs	   36.42</p>
<p>    Tax		    28.00	vs	   15.96</p>
<p>NOTE - Tea Smallholder Factories Ltd processes tea leaf bought from small cultivators. The company performed well in 1996, due to near record high prices for Sri Lanka tea, analysts said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
